OL,3,CFather and daughter who died at
OL,4,CCornish beach named
OL,6,FA father and daughter who died in a
OL,7,FCornish beach tragedy last month have
OL,8,Fbeen named ahead of an inquest opening.
OL,10,FPolice confirmed that two people died
OL,11,Fafter the late-night incident at
OL,12,FFistral Beach in Newquay on Sunday,
OL,13,FJuly 26. Emergency services, including
OL,14,Fthe police, coastguard and ambulance,
OL,15,Fwere seen at the beach from around
OL,16,F9.30pm and into the early hours.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/9
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
