OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F407A1785930476
OL,3,CFather and daughter who died at
OL,4,CCornish beach named
OL,6,FThe pair have now officially been
OL,7,Fnamed as John Peter Collins and his
OL,8,Fdaughter, Samantha Adele Collins, both
OL,9,Ffrom South Yorkshire. The 66-year-old
OL,10,Fman and 32-year-old woman were
OL,11,Fpronounced dead at the scene after
OL,12,Fbeing pulled from the water, police
OL,13,Fconfirmed.
OL,15,FAn inquest into their deaths will be
OL,16,Fopened tomorrow (Tuesday, August 4)
OL,17,Fand heard in full at a later date. The
OL,18,Finquest opening confirms they both
OL,19,Fdied in Newquay on July 26.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/9
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
