OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F407A1785930476
OL,3,CFather and daughter who died at
OL,4,CCornish beach named
OL,6,FFollowing the tragedy, Newquay Town
OL,7,FCouncil said: "We are extremely
OL,8,Fsaddened by the tragic events at
OL,9,FFistral Beach on Sunday evening, in
OL,10,Fwhich a father and daughter sadly lost
OL,11,Ftheir lives.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/9
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,408,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40704
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F407A1785930476
OL,3,CFather and daughter who died at
OL,4,CCornish beach named
OL,6,F"Our thoughts and heartfelt
OL,7,Fcondolences are with their family,
OL,8,Ffriends and loved ones at this
OL,9,Fincredibly difficult time. We would
OL,10,Falso like to acknowledge the efforts
OL,11,Fof the emergency services, RNLI
OL,12,Fvolunteers, coastguard teams and all
OL,13,Fthose who responded to the incident.
OL,14,FFollowing the incident, police have
OL,15,Fappealed for information regarding a
OL,16,Fhandbag belonging to one of the
OL,17,Fvictims, which is believed to contain
OL,18,Fpersonal items of significant
OL,19,Fsentimental value.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/9
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,408,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40705
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F407A1785930476
OL,3,CFather and daughter who died at
OL,4,CCornish beach named
OL,6,F"Anyone who may have found or seen an
OL,7,Forange or peach-coloured handbag with
OL,8,Fa shoulder strap is encouraged to
OL,9,Fcontact Devon and Cornwall Police. We
OL,10,Fask that the family's privacy is
OL,11,Frespected as they come to terms with
OL,12,Fthis devastating loss."
OL,14,FIn the latest update from Devon and
OL,15,FCornwall Police, a spokesperson said
OL,16,Fofficers were still looking for the
OL,17,Fbag. The statement said: "A father and
OL,18,Fdaughter have sadly died following an
OL,19,Fincident at Fistral Beach, Newquay, on
OL,20,FSunday evening.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/9
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,408,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40706
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F407A1785930476
OL,3,CFather and daughter who died at
OL,4,CCornish beach named
OL,6,F"Police were called by the South
OL,7,FWestern Ambulance Service at around
OL,8,F9.45pm on 26 July after reports that
OL,9,Ftwo people had been recovered from the
OL,10,Fwater. Coastguard rescue teams from
OL,11,FNewquay, Padstow and St Agnes attended
OL,12,Fthe scene, alongside Newquay RNLI
OL,13,Flifeboats and a HM Coastguard
OL,14,Fhelicopter.
OL,16,F"Despite the best efforts of emergency
OL,17,Fservices, a woman in her 30s and a man
OL,18,Fin his 60s, who were both from
OL,19,FDoncaster, were pronounced deceased at
OL,20,Fthe scene.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G6/9
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,408,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40707
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F407A1785930476
OL,3,CFather and daughter who died at
OL,4,CCornish beach named
OL,6,F"Their families have been informed,
OL,7,Fand thoughts are with them at this
OL,8,Fincredibly difficult time. A cordon
OL,9,Fwas put in place while emergency
OL,10,Fservices carried out their work but
OL,11,Fhas since been removed. A file will
OL,12,Fnow be prepared for HM Coroner.
OL,14,F"We would like to thank all the
OL,15,Femergency service personnel and the
OL,16,Fpublic involved in responding to this
OL,17,Ftragic incident.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G7/9
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,408,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40708
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F407A1785930476
OL,3,CFather and daughter who died at
OL,4,CCornish beach named
OL,6,F"We now understand that the woman who
OL,7,Fsadly lost her life had entered the
OL,8,Fwater carrying a handbag described as
OL,9,Forange or peach in colour, with a
OL,10,Fshoulder strap.
OL,12,F"The bag is believed to be leather-
OL,13,Fstyle and approximately 30cm by 30cm
OL,14,Fin size. It is thought to contain a
OL,15,Fnumber of personal items of great
OL,16,Fsentimental value to her loved ones.
OL,18,F"At what is an incredibly difficult
OL,19,Ftime for the family, they would take
OL,20,Fgreat comfort in being reunited with
OL,21,Fthese belongings if possible.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G8/9
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,408,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40709
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F407A1785930476
OL,3,CFather and daughter who died at
OL,4,CCornish beach named
OL,6,F"We would be very grateful if anyone
OL,7,Fwho finds a bag matching this
OL,8,Fdescription could hand it in to
OL,9,FNewquay Police Station or contact us,
OL,10,Fquoting the incident number
OL,11,F50260197209. Thank you for any
OL,12,Fassistance you may be able to provide."
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G9/9
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
